    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this beautifully refurbished and substantially reconfigured five-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned in a quiet and family-friendly cul-de-sac in Malahide. The property has been thoughtfully upgraded over recent years, creating bright, stylish and exceptionally versatile family accommodation.\r\n\r\nA particular highlight is the beautiful open-plan kitchen and dining area, which seamlessly connects to the bright and spacious sun room. The sun room has recently been upgraded with a new roof and opened up to create a wonderful sense of space and natural light. The contemporary kitchen, generous dining area, vaulted ceiling, rooflights and extensive glazing combine to create a superb space for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes five bedrooms. The original garage has been fully converted, insulated and reconfigured to provide for an office room, bathroom and laundry area, while a subsequent first-floor extension over the garage added two further bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property has also undergone extensive upgrading, including new front windows, front door and internal doors, along with beautifully refurbished main and en-suite bathrooms. The attic has been fully floored and benefits from a large Velux window, providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Malahide Village, Malahide Castle, the estuary, schools, sports facilities, shops, cafés and restaurants all within easy reach. Excellent bus and rail connections provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer - 1.92m (6'4\") x 3.99m (13'1\")\r\nWelcoming entrance with stylish patterned tiled flooring, ceiling coving and an elegant carpeted stair runner giving an immediate sense of style.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.57m (11'9\") x 4.48m (14'8\")\r\nElegant front living room with large picture window, wood-effect flooring, feature fireplace with solid fuel stove and ornate surround.\r\n\r\nDining Area - 4.64m (15'3\") x 4.33m (14'2\")\r\nGenerous open-plan dining space with laminate floor covering, cover ceilings, feature panel heater, recessed lighting and ample room for family dining, seamlessly connecting to kitchen and sun room for modern everyday living.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.59m (8'6\") x 4.33m (14'2\")\r\nContemporary L-shaped kitchen with shaker-style units, subway tiling, stone-effect counters and integrated appliances, opening to the dining area.\r\n\r\nSun Room - 4.88m (16'0\") x 3.45m (11'4\")\r\nBright rear reception with vaulted ceiling, multiple roof-lights and extensive glazing overlooking the garden, finished with timber flooring and doors to the patio.\r\n\r\nHall - 0.98m (3'3\") x 1.55m (5'1\")\r\nInner hallway linking ground floor office, bathroom and utility, with patterned floor tiling complementing the modern decor throughout.\r\n\r\nBath (Ground Floor) - 1.33m (4'4\") x 1.54m (5'1\")\r\nStylish guest WC with modern sanitary ware, tiled floor and contrasting wall colour, positioned conveniently off the inner hall.\r\n\r\nLaundry - 0.78m (2'7\") x 0.65m (2'2\")\r\nPractical utility closet with stacked washer and dryer and storage shelving, ideal for keeping household chores separate from living spaces.\r\n\r\nOffice (Ground Floor) - 2.42m (7'11\") x 3.14m (10'4\")\r\nVersatile room currently used as an office with built-in shelving, desk and herringbone flooring, perfect as home office or guest bedroom.\r\n\r\nHall (First Floor) - 4.38m (14'4\") x 3.18m (10'5\")\r\nBright landing with neutral decor and access to all bedrooms and bathrooms, offering space for a small work or reading nook.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.63m (11'11\") x 3.83m (12'7\")\r\nWell-proportioned main bedroom with large window to front, fitted wardrobes and access to a sleek en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nBath (First Floor) - 0.88m (2'11\") x 2.62m (8'7\")\r\nBeautifully finished family bathroom with walk-in shower, patterned floor tiles, half-height panelling and contemporary fittings.\r\n\r\nBath (En-suite) - 1.77m (5'10\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\r\nCompact en-suite shower room off the primary bedroom with modern tiling, black-framed shower and clean white sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.65m (12'0\") x 3.3m (10'10\")\r\nFront-facing double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and carpeted floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.71m (8'11\") x 2.39m (7'10\")\r\nBright double bedroom overlooking the front garden featuring generous built-in storage and space for desk or dressing area.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.42m (7'11\") x 4.49m (14'9\")\r\nWell-sized bedroom with large window and fitted wardrobes, currently arranged as a stylish room with ample storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 2.3m (7'7\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\r\nCosy single bedroom with rear aspect, perfect as a child`s room or additional study space.\r\n\r\nAttached Store\r\nExternal store room to rear garden, ideal for bikes, tools and outdoor equipment.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nEnclosed lawned garden with patio, mature planting, outdoor lighting and excellent privacy, offering a superb space for family enjoyment.\r\n\r\nFront Driveway\r\nSmart tarmac driveway with low-maintenance planting, providing off-street parking to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area – 151 Sq.M / 1625 Sq.Ft.\r\n\r\nExternally: There is ample parking to the front via. a tarmac driveway with mature planting to the boundary. The rear garden is south facing with a paved patio area acting as a sun-trap for those summer evenings. There is a lawn space to the rear and a block built shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "B-Rated\r\nRear & side extensions\r\nUtility room\r\nSouth facing\r\nGas central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nAlarm\r\nOffice room\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nFitted roller blinds\r\nAmple parking\r\nFeature fireplace with stove\r\nMaster en-suite\r\nContemporary fitted kitchen\r\nModern family bathroom\r\nPrivate landscaped garden\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac setting\r\nExcellent location\r\nLocal amenities nearby"
      },
